  "scope": "Reviewed work and authorized admission form recorded mandates. Recorded proposals can alter an operative technical decision rule only through the supplied governance procedure. Handoffs retain that rule and its history but restrict actual participation; inherited variants admit different later continuations. The actual two-module closure is audited. Illustrative finite protocol, not a biological model or a calibrated organizational simulator. Seed mandate, recognized records, copying infrastructure, participation, event content, compliance and fixed meta-governance remain supplied. No productivity, ethical merit, legal compliance or population selection advantage is proved."
